Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.49,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I received this notice that she is\N withdrawing from the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.21,0:00:10.11,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why didn't you stop her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:16.27,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Enrolled students hold the right to \Nreceive instruction to become a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:19.33,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,They are also at full liberty \Nto relinquish that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:25.46,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,It is not my duty to stop those \Nwho choose to leave the academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.17,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How can you be so heartless?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:31.14,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Every child must one day \Nleave their parents' nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:33.50,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I do consider myself an adult, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:36.09,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so uncouth as to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:37.17,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.93,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm not done here yet! Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.07,0:00:39.93,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Calm down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:41.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Take a good look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.31,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:46.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:49.90,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,We'll make sure we bring Sophie back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.45,0:00:51.42,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:54.66,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,And do you know where she's headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:00:57.16,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,She'll be looking for her five sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:58.62,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,According to my investigation,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.05,0:01:02.56,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,it looks like they go between \Na number of different bases.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.79,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Should we start looking \Nat the most likely ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:05.85,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.85,0:01:06.80,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Let's get going, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.06,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:13.95,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Have you thought about \Nwhy she went by herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:15.67,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.47,0:01:20.70,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Sophie didn't want any of \Nyou to sully your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:21.51,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:25.68,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,The only way to stop those five...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.14,0:01:27.19,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,is to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:28.86,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.86,0:01:31.25,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,There must be some other \Nway to convince them...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.96,0:01:34.60,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Those girls will stop at nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.60,0:01:39.32,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Sophie went alone precisely\N because she realized that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:43.08,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,The world is more than what \Nwe see in the light of day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.08,0:01:49.17,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,and she knows that she existed \Nin the shadows to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:54.19,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That's why she wants to put an \Nend to this with her own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:57.13,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,So her friends will not dirty theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:02.65,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,You all need to think long and \Nhard about this until dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:09.40,sign_4627_53_Episode_11,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1189)\pos(75.273,309.909)}{\3c&HC6D1E4&}Episode 12
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:09.40,sign_2979_42_The_Sophie_Serie,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1189)\pos(261.455,301.909)}{\3c&HC6D1E4&}The Sophie Series (Part 2)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:13.48,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.99,0:02:16.91,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,Master, you are going to \Nsearch for Sophie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:17.75,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.75,0:02:19.27,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I'll go, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.27,0:02:21.49,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Sophie is my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.74,0:02:24.78,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,I shall be by your side, \Nwherever you go, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:26.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Just the three of us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.47,0:02:29.25,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Hm? I'm going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:33.87,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Did Maria agree to this as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:38.38,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,That crybaby said that she \Ncan't abandon a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:39.75,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:41.57,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So that makes five of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:43.56,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Shall we get going, Great Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm not the Great Hero anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:00.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, you're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:01.81,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,See, didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:06.08,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I figured Blade was just waiting \Naround the dorm entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:07.45,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,What, Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:09.01,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Couldn't make up your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:11.89,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,How sluggish for a superorganism.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:14.34,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,It only took me five minutes to decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.99,0:03:18.34,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,My bad for being so late!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.86,0:03:20.78,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:39.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.77,0:03:43.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Eliza, I found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.70,0:03:44.75,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.33,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,I'll send everyone your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:47.87,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:49.22,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Stop running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:54.18,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Please, let's talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.18,0:03:56.36,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I have a request as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.93,0:03:58.46,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Please let me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.95,0:04:06.22,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,We all understand how you feel, \Nand what you're trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:09.28,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So there's no need to worry...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:10.22,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:11.23,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:16.10,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,There's something I haven't told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.78,0:04:27.13,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I am a human who was created for \Nthe Artificial Great Hero Project.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.99,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Artificial... Great Hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.65,0:04:33.93,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,During the war, research was conducted \Nto try and artificially produce a human
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.93,0:04:37.14,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,with powers equal or greater \Nto the Great Hero's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:40.38,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I was the twelfth test subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.63,0:04:45.19,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Everyone who took part in the \Nresearch was supposedly arrested,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.19,0:04:48.99,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,but I hear that some samples and \Nresearch data have been stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:51.64,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Those five girls are the samples in question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:56.07,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Someone continued the research,\N incubating them and giving them commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:04:58.87,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,The reason they exist...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:05:00.52,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,is to surpass the Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:02.15,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,The Great Hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:04.09,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,You mean the one and only?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.09,0:05:07.16,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,But if that's the case, \Nwhy are they after Blade's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.58,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.62,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:14.33,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,They want to test their capabilities \Non this superorganism!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:17.17,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,If they can't even defeat a superorganism,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:19.52,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,they stand no chance against \Nthe Great Hero himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:20.63,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:23.38,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.38,0:05:25.82,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure, that's gotta be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:28.66,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,They can be quite dense, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:33.17,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I've caused you all so much \Ntrouble by getting you involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:34.62,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That's not true...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:37.83,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,My past has finally caught up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:44.68,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I wondered all along whether it was okay \Nto have so much fun... to be so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:51.03,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Was it okay for a human impostor like me\N to live happily as a real person?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:56.29,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going back \Nto where I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:59.23,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll protect all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.23,0:06:02.20,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Even if it costs me my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:07.73,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It may not have been for long, \Nbut being able to walk out in the sun...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.30,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.38,0:06:12.49,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:16.06,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Ow... that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:17.67,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:21.69,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If walking in the sun makes you happy, \Nthen keep doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:24.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I mean, I also used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:26.85,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,have eyes like {\i1}this{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:29.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,and I never looked like I was \Nhappy or having fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:30.85,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:31.98,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:36.85,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,But look, thanks to Blade, \NI was able to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.85,0:06:39.71,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You turned into a bit too \Nmuch of a lost cause, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:49.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Besides, if killing them is the \Nonly solution, then we'll also...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:52.34,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, we won't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:53.35,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.35,0:06:55.01,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,But His Majesty said...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.01,0:06:59.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I know what the king said, \Nbut killing them isn't the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:02.28,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.28,0:07:07.08,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Thanks to their neural programming, \Ntheir creator's orders are absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:09.74,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Is there nothing we can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:12.18,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Even if there were...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:14.95,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Because of all the harsh \Nmodifications they've undergone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:17.06,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,they don't have much longer to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:18.50,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,How awful...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:20.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You have a plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:21.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Nope, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:22.73,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.33,0:07:25.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Still, I want to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:27.99,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I want to save Sophie's sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:29.34,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Sisters...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:33.22,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Which is why I want all of you to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:42.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Sophie, are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:45.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:48.04,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Give your life to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:49.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:49.68,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.68,0:07:51.24,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That was fast! Are you sure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:54.19,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I mean... that's... He just....
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:54.19,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,What are you getting \Nworked up about, Earnest?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.19,0:07:55.71,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I-I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:58.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You want to be friends \Nwith those girls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:00.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So, do you have any good ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:07.10,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,You're leaving it all to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:09.76,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Well, sure, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.76,0:08:12.26,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I've come up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.52,0:08:21.81,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Let me know when you can't move anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.81,0:08:23.23,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,I'll dispose of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:24.20,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:25.84,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,You know I'm still good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:27.04,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,I'll crush you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:29.26,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,I still wanna destroy more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:30.85,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:35.78,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,Yes, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:42.29,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,The only reason you exist is \Nto transcend the Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.93,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,Kill the Great Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:48.29,Class- Default,Researcher,0,0,0,,Kill, kill, kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.14,0:08:51.42,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Une.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.51,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,I found this outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:55.40,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,A letter of challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:56.64,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,It must be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:06.62,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,We'll put an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.85,0:09:20.66,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Do you really think they'll \Nanswer that challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.40,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.52,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I know I would go for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:26.04,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:27.42,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Sniff, sniff...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:30.29,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I smell the same scent as Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.10,0:09:32.05,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,They have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.39,0:09:39.22,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,We'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:41.31,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,That is what we exist to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.97,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:45.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I was hoping I could be \Nfriends with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:48.54,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,You understand the plan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:50.81,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,You will be the only one fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.37,0:09:54.68,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,If we attack as a group, \Nthey're sure to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:57.15,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,However, with only one target,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:10:00.32,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,they should continue to fight, \Neven knowing that it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:04.96,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.96,0:10:08.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I know the plan,\Nbut not being able to help...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.04,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:16.51,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,The goal is not to defeat them, \Nbut to deplete their energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:15.56,Class - Top,Deux,0,0,0,,C'mon, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:16.51,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Adamantine Body!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:20.84,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,Please endure all of their attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:20.84,Class - Top,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:29.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:31.19,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,I know the superorganism can pull it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.94,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,If you manage to deplete their energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:37.19,Class- Default,Dione,0,0,0,,Be on constant lookout, \Nand don't break the blockade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:40.85,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,There must be someone\N giving orders to the five of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:42.20,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,Make sure you capture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:46.24,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}this{\i0} is a realistic exercise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:48.51,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,No, it's the real deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:50.71,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,We'll arrest the person who created them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.71,0:10:54.59,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Then, we'll make them tell us the \Nparameters to reprogram and save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:56.84,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,So... please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.07,0:11:00.56,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.71,0:11:05.18,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Hey, teach me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:06.14,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,How to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:08.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:13.77,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:17.41,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Have faith in Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:18.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.48,0:11:19.79,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:20.65,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.54,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,He can still use moves like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:35.46,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Not being able to do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:37.29,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Other than sit and watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:38.23,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.83,0:11:41.30,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,There's still something \Nwe can do, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:48.68,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:54.99,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Deadly Earth Crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:57.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?! The ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:12:00.44,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Be crushed by the planet, and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:05.49,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Three! Two! One!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.18,0:12:13.73,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,I'll send you to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:15.42,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.01,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Are they all real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:24.13,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:25.14,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:32.81,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:35.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragon Smash!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:40.17,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.17,0:12:41.74,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.94,0:12:45.91,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:49.74,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,I'll wipe you out, jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:50.66,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:57.84,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,This is the Super God Technique, \NAbsolutely Unbreakable Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:13:00.17,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Ugh, {\i1}that{\i0} sure is a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:02.29,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,So this is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.14,0:13:05.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:06.93,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.19,0:13:12.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Earnest, hand that over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.03,0:13:14.70,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh? But your sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:15.99,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Believe in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:17.31,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.31,0:13:22.32,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.32,0:13:23.84,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:25.06,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.06,0:13:26.49,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:31.35,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:34.16,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Take control of this power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:37.71,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It should be easier for the \Nreal Great Hero, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:39.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:40.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It'll be pretty painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.43,0:13:43.97,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,My life belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:45.72,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Use it all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:50.97,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:52.37,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Great Hero Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:05.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You did well, Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:06.38,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.32,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.29,0:14:21.33,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Um, what was that move called again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:23.25,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, whatever works, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.69,0:14:26.01,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Earnest Monster Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:28.51,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't give it a weird name!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.47,0:15:05.84,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Not gonna finish me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.98,0:15:10.30,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,My time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:11.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.15,0:15:13.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:15.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:19.32,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:20.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,By time, you don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:24.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.43,0:15:25.44,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:30.37,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Our lifespan... measured in days...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:32.20,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,is fourteen days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:36.95,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Until... sunset today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:40.49,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,How beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:42.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Eliza!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.81,0:15:43.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You heard her, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:45.50,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There's no time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:46.96,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,We're out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:52.13,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I just finished looking over \Nthe research data from
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:54.47,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,the modification facility \Nwhere they were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:57.96,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,What atrocious workmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:16:01.98,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I'd say they were lucky to \Nlast fourteen whole days...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:03.90,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.90,0:16:04.98,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:06.86,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I can't heal them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:10.99,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,The powers of the Great Hero and \NDemon King defy the laws of physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.49,0:16:13.60,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,They disrupt the laws of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:17.51,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Claire's powers work by decreasing entropy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:19.49,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,They won't work when \Ncausality has been severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.78,0:16:22.99,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Isn't there some way to save them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:23.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.36,0:16:26.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There's the person who made \NUne and the others, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:27.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If we ask them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:28.80,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:32.00,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,We did find their creator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:33.13,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.48,0:16:35.93,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.73,0:16:39.40,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,And not within the last fourteen days!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:40.43,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Long before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:44.53,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,By the time they were born,\N he was already dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.53,0:16:47.88,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,The truth is... that there \Nnever were any commands...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:51.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Can't you do something with \Nthat science of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:53.81,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I could do research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:59.88,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,With my intellect, I might be able \Nto find a way to reprogram them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:01.91,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,But there's not enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:05.52,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,Science has its limits as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:08.92,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,It can't solve everything \Nin the snap of your fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.50,0:17:13.66,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:17.14,Class - Italics,Eliza,0,0,0,,If only I was more of a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:18.15,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.18,0:17:23.85,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Bring all of them... my sisters, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.90,0:17:26.90,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Une.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.90,0:17:28.38,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.69,0:17:33.44,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You still haven't used your \NArtificial Great Hero Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.09,0:17:37.84,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You will all die,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:42.95,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,but there's a way for you to keep living.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.37,0:17:46.26,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,I failed to carry out my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.77,0:17:49.96,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,What point is there in living?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:51.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You can surpass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:54.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Keep on living, and try to surpass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:57.01,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,If you can, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:18:01.72,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Hmm, that sounds pretty fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.95,0:18:03.43,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,There's no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:05.98,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,But the chances aren't zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:10.11,Class- Default,Quatre,0,0,0,,I might win if it was a different activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:12.61,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy, destroy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:15.52,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Une.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:19.71,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:23.55,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:25.47,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:28.20,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Take control of her power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.10,0:18:33.68,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,So that their souls... \Ntheir minds... enter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:34.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:35.88,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:19.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Um... are you Une?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:20.32,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:21.78,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:24.33,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,I just came to see if \Nyou were feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:27.66,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,When you are, I'll be the one to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:28.52,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Don't forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:30.13,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:31.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's what you all say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:33.77,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What about the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:37.42,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,They say they want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:38.73,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,But before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.49,0:19:43.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:44.69,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:47.14,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It looks like my sisters let me take control.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:49.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sounds like you have it rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:50.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.37,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:55.04,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It feels like having six children.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:56.94,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Six?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.05,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Isn't that one too many?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.05,0:20:09.11,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The sunny disposition that \Nbrings a smile to your face
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.11,0:20:14.86,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,As well as the heroic sense of justice
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:20.03,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,They may be a part of me, \Nbut that's not all there is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:22.73,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,That image of me
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.73,0:20:25.45,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Has taken on a life of its own
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:28.12,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.12,0:20:30.54,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Won't you be friends with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:35.23,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Let's shake hands, another self of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.89,0:20:38.65,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The wounds we cannot bear alone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:41.32,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The dangers that we keep hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:43.99,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,We're all hiding them within
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.99,0:20:46.98,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Standing ready to strike
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:49.41,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The shadow lurking beneath the light
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:53.69,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The muffled sounds coming from my lips
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:59.17,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,They make me feel that I am alive
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:01.01,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,It's a sign
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:27.80,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Ah, it's hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.11,0:21:29.97,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}my{\i0} turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:38.12,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Now this is a {\i1}true{\i0} realistic exercise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:38.87,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,Gil.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:41.57,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,About the magical beast brought here today...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.10,0:21:45.82,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,I received word that there's been a mix-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.34,0:21:49.69,Class- Default,Dione,0,0,0,,It seems they delivered a different \Nbeast than the one you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.69,0:21:51.83,Class- Default,Dione,0,0,0,,I thought it was a little too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.40,0:21:55.33,Class- Default,Doctor,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm going to be busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.27,0:21:58.71,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Knock 'em dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:21:58.96,sign_31621_391_Final_Ep___Good_,Sign,0,0,0,,Final Ep!! Good Work!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.73,0:22:05.26,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Blargh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.26,0:22:07.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hi-yah-yah-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.01,0:22:11.47,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hi-yah-yah-yah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:14.53,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, Asmodeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.53,0:22:16.02,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You can do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.55,0:22:18.08,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,No more...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.08,0:22:19.77,Class- Default,Asmodeus,0,0,0,,I'm really done for...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:21.12,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.12,0:22:22.27,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Let us fight in tandem!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:24.53,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Why me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:30.18,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Please, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.94,0:22:33.84,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.84,0:22:34.79,Class- Default,Une,0,0,0,,Dragon Smash!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:35.79,Class- Default,Deux,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.13,0:22:37.79,Class- Default,Trois,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.01,0:22:38.79,Class- Default,Cinq,0,0,0,,Destroy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.79,0:22:40.79,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:45.30,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,How many does that make?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:46.55,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,I'll land the final blow—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:50.85,Class- Default,Mao,0,0,0,,Bow before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:53.30,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,According to my high-spec calculations...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.10,0:22:56.38,Class- Default,Iona,0,0,0,,No effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.05,0:23:02.06,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,It really doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:11.82,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Oh, there's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.99,0:23:25.50,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,After all, he's the Great Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:26.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.90,0:23:28.67,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's wrong, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.26,0:23:32.54,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Mmm! This tonkatsu curry's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.54,0:23:34.01,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You lousy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:37.66,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Superorganism!
